program DiceScore

Scores a single roll of five dice under a simplified tabletop rule.

interface
  input  dice: list<integer>
  output score: integer

Requirement 1: Sets
  IF three or more dice show the same face THEN the system SHALL score that face multiplied by one hundred
  IF five dice show the same face THEN the system SHALL score two thousand instead

Requirement 2: Singles
  THE SYSTEM SHALL score each remaining die showing one as fifty points
  THE SYSTEM SHALL score each remaining die showing five as ten points

Requirement 3: Nothing
  IF no rule above applies THEN the system SHALL return 0
